{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"库存运营管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abc-classification","title":"ABC 分类管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations/abc-classification","wordCount":1397,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"promotion-inventory-planning","title":"大促备货规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations/promotion-inventory-planning","wordCount":1246,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"inventory-health-metrics","title":"库存健康指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-inventory-forecasting/operations/inventory-health-metrics","wordCount":1322,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"库存运营管理\">库存运营管理</h1><p>再好的预测和补货算法，也需要匹配运营管理框架才能落地。本章聚焦三个实操层面：用 ABC/XYZ 分类实现差异化库存策略；制定双十一等大促的系统备货方案；建立覆盖周转效率、缺货风险、资金回报的库存健康指标体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>内容概要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><a href=\"abc-classification\">ABC分类管理</a></td>\n<td>Pareto分类(营收/利润/周转)与差异化策略矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><a href=\"promotion-inventory-planning\">大促备货规划</a></td>\n<td>需求uplift预估、提前期压缩、爆品分仓与应急补货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"inventory-health-metrics\">库存健康指标</a></td>\n<td>周转天数、缺货率、滞销率、库存准确率、GMROI</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"}